    43	## Ruling update (2026-11-14 ~20:55 EST — owner's judgment-call ruling)
    44	ARMING = FIRING abolishes the arming states printed in this index: this job's calls are DEFINED and fire unconditionally in its next live cycle (raw responses filed in the run record); verdicts are advisory (applied, or set aside with the miss + the call-file amendment recorded in Condense). The founding Presence print stands as the 2026-11-14 founding record; from the next cycle, the presence evaluation prices FIRING (fired / not fired — not fired = INCOMPLETE), not arming.
