item-T227-observe-plan.md:78:- **Fixed census-instant probes (C*, alongside — never the sole census assertions; each carries its full observed-state assertions, AS AMENDED at §2b):** C@1000 — contact begun (bladeEngaged = 1), flesh 0, tilt moving (CP1). C@2000 — tilt = CONFIG.objTiltDeg (horizontal pose), flesh = 0 (shell-only sawing), bladeEngaged = 1 (CP2). C@3000 — 0 < fleshFraction < 1 (extrusion in progress: sawP = (3000−900)/2600 = 0.8077, flesh = (0.8077−0.62)/0.38 = 0.494) AND bladeEngaged = 1 with the blade at the cut line (cover state, CP3). C@4000 — sawP = 1, fleshFraction = 1 (cut face established), partP = (4000 − partStartMs)/partDurMs = 0.714 (CP4). C@5000 — the CLOSED HOLD explicitly: separationPx = 0, seamVisible = 1 at seamWPx, bladeP = 0, state equal to P5 (CP5).
